to health while you go...

00:05:34.751 --> 00:05:37.421
But in the end they shoot you,
but you teach us about things.

00:05:56.648 --> 00:05:58.192
Oh, just a flying saucer.

00:05:58.275 --> 00:06:00.611
Excuse me. You can't park here.

00:06:00.694 --> 00:06:02.029
The parking area is over there.

00:06:06.825 --> 00:06:08.285
Wow, nice tube.

00:06:09.620 --> 00:06:11.496
Hey, hey, what's the big idea?

00:06:11.580 --> 00:06:12.956
